WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.190
- So, did you have like a
secret crush growing up?

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.850
Like maybe in the public eye?

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.730
- I did, I did.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.112
I had a few, but I think the one

00:00:08.112 --> 00:00:12.000
that sort of trumps the rest was

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.830
I used to, by my bed

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:18.080
when I was about 16, 17,

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.130
I had a sort of glossy,
like picture-quality

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.000
gloss finished photograph of Liv Tyler.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.060
- Oh!
- And I

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.814
used to give it a wee kiss
before I went to sleep.

00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:33.490
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:35.850
And then, cut to...

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.923
15 years later maybe.

00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:44.104
I'm in New York and I'm
with a friend of mine

00:00:44.104 --> 00:00:47.330
who I'd worked with, and she's an actress,

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:48.810
and she was like...

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:52.120
I told her that story before,
and then she's on the phone

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:53.760
and she's acting funny and she's giggling

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:57.464
and then she hands me the
phone and it's Liv Tyler.

00:00:57.464 --> 00:00:58.620
- Oh!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.980
- I speak to Liv Tyler on the phone

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:01.380
and I don't know if you know Liv Tyler,

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:04.160
but she's got like the
sweetest voice in the world.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.294
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:05.294 --> 00:01:07.320
- And she's like, "Oh
my God, I can't believe,

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.710
like, ah, that's the sweetest thing."

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.870
I was like, oh my god, I can't believe

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:15.630
I'm having to deal with
this and tell this woman

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.900
that I used to kiss her face every night

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:18.757
before I went to sleep.

00:01:18.757 --> 00:01:19.698
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:19.698 --> 00:01:21.465
But you know, she's very cool about it.

00:01:21.465 --> 00:01:22.932
- (laughing) That was amazing!

00:01:22.932 --> 00:01:24.387
The best part of that whole story

00:01:24.387 --> 00:01:26.606
was your impersonation of her voice.

00:01:26.606 --> 00:01:27.449
(audience laughing)

